# FocusFlow AI — Microservices Edition Task List

## Project Overview
Build **FocusFlow AI v2.0** — a personal productivity platform re-architected from a monolithic JavaFX + SQLite app into a distributed microservices system.

**Stack:** Java 21 · Spring Boot 3.2 · JavaFX 21 · PostgreSQL 16 · Docker Compose · Anthropic Claude (Sonnet 4.6)

---

## Phase 1 — v2.0 Alpha: Session Service + Infrastructure (Week 1–2)

### 1.1 Project Scaffolding
- [x] Create monorepo directory structure: `api-gateway/`, `session-service/`, `coach-service/`, `study-service/`, `javafx-client/`
- [x] Initialize Maven [pom.xml](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/api-gateway/pom.xml) for each service with correct dependencies
- [ ] Create [.env.example](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/.env.example) and [.gitignore](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/.gitignore) (exclude `.env`)

### 1.2 Session Service (:8081)
- [ ] Spring Boot project with `spring-boot-starter-web`, `spring-boot-starter-data-jpa`, `postgresql`, `lombok`
- [ ] [Session.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/model/Session.java) — JPA entity (`id`, `tag`, `durationMinutes`, `startTime`, `endTime`, `completed`)
- [ ] [Tag.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/model/Tag.java) — JPA entity (`id`, `name`, `color`)
- [ ] [SessionRepository.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/session-service/src/main/java/com/focusflow/session/repository/SessionRepository.java) — Spring Data JPA
- [x] [SessionService.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/session-service/src/main/java/com/focusflow/session/service/SessionService.java) — business logic ([start](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/App.java#11-25), [complete](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/session-service/src/main/java/com/focusflow/session/controller/SessionController.java#28-33), [cancel](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/session-service/src/main/java/com/focusflow/session/controller/SessionController.java#34-39), [buildStats](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/session-service/src/main/java/com/focusflow/session/service/SessionService.java#93-125), [buildTextSummary](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/session-service/src/main/java/com/focusflow/session/service/SessionService.java#155-186))
- [x] [SessionController.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/session-service/src/main/java/com/focusflow/session/controller/SessionController.java) endpoints:
  - [x] `POST /api/sessions` — create/start session
  - [x] `PUT /api/sessions/{id}/complete`
  - [x] `PUT /api/sessions/{id}/cancel`
  - [x] `GET /api/sessions` (with `limit`, `offset`, `tag` query params)
  - [x] `GET /api/sessions/stats` — aggregate stats JSON
  - [x] `GET /api/sessions/summary` — plain-text summary for AI Coach
  - [x] `GET /api/sessions/tags` — list tags
  - [x] `POST /api/sessions/tags` — create tag
- [x] PostgreSQL schema: `sessions` + `tags` tables
- [x] [application.yml](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml) / `application.properties` with datasource config

### 1.3 Docker Compose
- [x] [docker-compose.yml](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/docker-compose.yml) with all services: `api-gateway`, `session-service`, `coach-service`, `study-service`, `session-db`, `coach-db`, `study-db`
- [x] Volumes for persistent PostgreSQL data (`session-data`, `study-data`)
- [x] Environment variable wiring (`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, DB credentials, `SESSION_SERVICE_URL`)
- [x] [Dockerfile](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/api-gateway/Dockerfile) for each Spring Boot service

