## Phase 3 — v2.0 RC: JavaFX Client Refactor (Week 4)

### 3.1 JavaFX Client
- [x] [ApiClient.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/service/ApiClient.java) — shared REST client using Java `HttpClient` + Gson
  - `BASE_URL = "http://localhost:8080"`
  - [getAsync(path, type)](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/service/ApiClient.java#44-67) → `CompletableFuture<T>`
  - [postAsync(path, body, type)](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/service/ApiClient.java#91-116) → `CompletableFuture<T>`
  - [putAsync(path, body, type)](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/service/ApiClient.java#117-140) → `CompletableFuture<T>`
- [x] Remove all SQLite references from existing code
- [x] [TimerController.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/controller/TimerController.java) — async session start/complete/cancel via [ApiClient](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/service/ApiClient.java#19-186)
- [x] [StatsController.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/controller/StatsController.java) — load stats from `GET /api/sessions/stats`
- [x] [HistoryController.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/controller/HistoryController.java) — paginated history from `GET /api/sessions`
- [x] [AiCoachController.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/controller/AiCoachController.java) — call `POST /api/coach/insights` async (show loading state)
- [x] [StudyController.java](file:///c:/Users/chira/Desktop/%E2%98%95%20Focus%20Flow/javafx-client/src/main/java/com/focusflowai/controller/StudyController.java) — deck list, generate deck, flip cards, mark known
- [x] All API calls use `CompletableFuture` + `Platform.runLater()` for thread safety
- [x] UX: dark theme (navy/charcoal + red accent `#E94560`), Inter/Segoe UI fonts, monospace timer

