## Phase 4 — v2.0 Final: Integration + Polish (Week 5)

- [x] End-to-end integration testing (Timer → Session Service → AI Coach flow)
- [x] `docker compose up --build` → all services healthy on first run
- [x] Verify PostgreSQL data persists across service restarts
- [x] Health check curl commands pass for all endpoints
- [x] Error responses follow standard envelope `{status, error, message, timestamp}`
- [x] README / developer setup documentation

