## Phase 5 — v2.1 Features (Month 2)
- [ ] CSV export of session history
- [ ] Custom tags UI (create, rename, color-code)
- [ ] Quiz mode (multiple-choice from deck)
- [ ] Weekly chart view (JavaFX Charts)

---

## Success Criteria (v2.0)
- [ ] All 3 backend services start with `docker compose up`
- [ ] JavaFX client connects to Gateway and completes full session flow end-to-end
- [ ] AI Coach returns insights in < 10 seconds
- [ ] Study Coach generates 5-card deck from 500 words in < 15 seconds
- [ ] Session data survives service restarts
- [ ] Zero breaking changes to JavaFX UI when backend redeploys
